## Why This Is Asked

Assesses designing a privacy-conscious, on-device NLP feature with energy, storage, and regulatory constraints, plus a quantified cost-benefit trade-off.

## Key Concepts

- On-device ML and multilingual support
- Energy budgeting, latency targets, local storage planning
- Privacy budgets, regulatory/compliance costs, opt-in controls
- Staged rollout and metrics for go/no-go decisions

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo inference loop for on-device summarization
function summarize(conversation, model) {
  // assume preloaded model in memory
  const chunk = chunkify(conversation, 512);
  return chunk.map(c => model.infer(c)).join(" ");
}
```

